Fluxer (https://github.com/fluxerapp/fluxer)
  Space chat (src/features/spaces/chat/fluxer) copies Fluxer's chat layout, in Misty's colors,
  type and icons: the design tokens, the channel column, guild header menu, channel rows, user
  area, channel header and message search, member list, message list, markup, dividers,
  welcome, reactions, message action bar, context menu, composer, autocomplete, inline editing,
  tooltip, scroller, emoji picker and avatar presence. Its CSS modules are copied with sizes
  converted from rem to px, and its components are adapted to Misty's Spaces; each file names
  its Fluxer source. The emoji data (src/features/spaces/chat/fluxer/assets/emojis.json, from
  Unicode emoji-test and CLDR annotations) comes from its app source.

  GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later (the license Misty is under).

